<div class="accordion"><div class="accordion-item"><button id="accordion-button-1" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">Are bubble wall panels noisy?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="accordion-content"><p>No, they are extremely quiet and designed to produce a gentle bubbling sound that enhances relaxation without disrupting conversations.</p></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><button id="accordion-button-2" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">How do I maintain my bubble wall panel?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="accordion-content"><p>Routine maintenance includes cleaning the acrylic surface and occasionally checking the air pump and filters.</p></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><button id="accordion-button-3" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">Can the lighting be customized?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="accordion-content"><p>Yes! Our LED systems allow full control over color, brightness, and transitions to match your environment.</p></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><button id="accordion-button-4" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">Are your bubble wall panels safe for children and pets?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="accordion-content"><p>Absolutely. They are sealed units with no external water flow, making them a safe, stylish option for homes and public spaces.</p></div></div>
